    "heading": "ERLING HAALAND",
    "sub": "DORTMUND · 2022",
    "pill": "WHAT IF?",
    "person": "haalandbvb"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Haaland's Dortmund contract had a release clause. On the tenth of May twenty twenty-two, City triggered it.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "text",
    "heading": "10 MAY 2022",
    "body": "Manchester City announce an agreement with Borussia Dortmund for Erling Haaland, paying his €60m release clause."
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "About fifty-one million pounds. For a striker that age, it looked like a steal.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stats",
    "title": "THE CLAUSE",
    "items": [
     {
      "n": "€60m",
      "l": "release clause"
     },
     {
