  },
  {
   "text": "Reports said Madrid didn't want to sign both in the same summer.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "person",
    "person": "perez",
    "label": "REAL MADRID",
    "mood": "flat"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Eleven days after City's announcement, Mbappé said no to Madrid and signed a new deal at PSG.",
