    "type": "timeline",
    "items": [
     {
      "year": "10 May",
      "label": "City sign Haaland"
     },
     {
      "year": "21 May",
      "label": "Mbappé stays at PSG"
     },
     {
      "year": "Summer",
      "label": "Madrid get neither"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Madrid ended that summer with neither of them.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stamp",
    "text": "NEITHER",
    "color": "red",
    "person": "perez"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Haaland's first season? Thirty-six Premier League goals, a record, fifty-two in all, and the treble.",
   "scene": {
